<body>

<div style="text-align:center;margin:24px 0"><img src="../_svg/decimal_grid.svg" alt="" style="max-width:95%;height:auto;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.1)"></div>

<div class="lf-page">
<div class="lf-cover">
<div class="lf-cover-logo">LF Academy · LF Academy</div>
<div class="lf-cover-grade">小四 · 第 29 堂 · Student Edition Handout</div>
<div class="lf-cover-title">DecimalWord Problems</div>
<div class="lf-cover-subtitle">購物 · 長度 · 重量情境 · 65 min</div>
<div class="lf-cover-info">
<b>Textbook Reference：</b>《小學數學新思維（第二版）》4下C冊 單元四<br/>
<b>核心Trap：</b>🪤 單位換算（米↔厘米·公斤↔克）· 找續計算 · 總和vs差額<br/>
<b>SSPA 關聯：</b><span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-high">🔴 高頻</span> 呈分試文字題每年必出，生活情境題<br/>
<b>Prerequisites：</b>L26-L28 Decimal認識+比較+加減<br/>
<b>Lesson Objectives：</b>❶ 購物情境（找續、總價）❷ 長度情境 ❸ 重量情境 ❹ 混合情境
  </div>
<div class="lf-cover-row">
<span>Student Name：<span class="lf-line"></span></span><span>Class：<span class="lf-line"></span></span><span>Date：<span class="lf-line"></span></span><span>Duration：<span class="lf-line"></span></span>
</div>
</div>
<div>
<div class="lf-h1">一、Warm-Up （5 min）（共 5 題，5 min）</div>

<div class="lf-game"><div class="lf-game-title">🔢 小數點獵人</div><div class="lf-game-desc">追蹤小數點位置！乘法向右、除法向左。小心0的數量陷阱！</div><div class="lf-game-action">🎯 開始追蹤 →</div></div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">1</td><td>$5.80 + $3.50 = ？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:38px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">2</td><td>1 米 = ？厘米。0.5 米 = ？厘米。</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">3</td><td>1 公斤 = ？克。0.3 公斤 = ？克。</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">4</td><td>支付 $20 買 $12.80 的書，找續 = ？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">5</td><td>一枝筆長 15.5 cm，另一枝長 12.8 cm。兩枝筆相差多少 cm？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h1">二、Core Knowledge （15 min） ＋ Worked Examples</div>
<div class="lf-kp">
<div class="lf-kp-title">知識點一：購物情境 — 總價、找續、差額 <span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-high">🔴 SSPA</span></div>
<div class="lf-kp-rules">
      ① <b>總價 = 各項價錢相加</b>（Decimal點對齊！）<br/>
      ② <b>找續 = 付款 - 總價</b>。付款通常係整數，總價係Decimal<br/>
      ③ <b>差額 = 較貴 - 較便宜</b>。「A比B貴幾多」= A 減 B<br/>
      ④ <b>「買幾多送幾多」：</b>計總件數→計應付錢的件數→×單價<br/>
      ⑤ <b>Trap：</b>睇清楚係「每人」定「總共」！「各買一個」vs「合共」
    </div>
</div>
<div class="lf-ex"><div class="lf-ex-title">例1</div><div class="lf-ex-q">鉛筆 $4.50，擦膠 $2.80，間尺 $3.20。買齊三樣要付多少？付 $20，找回多少？</div></div>
<div class="lf-ex"><div class="lf-ex-title">例2</div><div class="lf-ex-q">A 店賣 $35.80，B 店賣 $32.50。A 店比 B 店貴多少？在哪間買較划算？</div></div>
<div class="lf-kp">
<div class="lf-kp-title">知識點二：長度與重量情境 <span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-high">🔴 SSPA</span></div>
<div class="lf-kp-rules">
      ① <b>單位換算：</b>1m = 100cm、1kg = 1000g、1L = 1000mL<br/>
      ② <b>Decimal換算：</b>0.35m = 35cm（×100）。150cm = 1.5m（÷100）<br/>
      ③ <b>比較前先統一單位！</b>唔好 0.5m 同 30cm 直接加<br/>
      ④ <b>餘下/剩下：</b>總長 - 已用 - 已用 = 剩餘
    </div>
</div>
<div class="lf-ex"><div class="lf-ex-title">例3</div><div class="lf-ex-q">一條繩長 2.5 米。剪去 0.85 米做手工，再剪去 1.2 米包禮物。剩下多少米？合多少厘米？</div></div>
<div class="lf-kp">
<div class="lf-kp-title">知識點三：混合情境 + 多步驟 <span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-high">🟡 SSPA</span></div>
<div class="lf-kp-rules">
      ① <b>購物+找續+分配：</b>總價→找續→每人分幾多<br/>
      ② <b>長度+重量混合：</b>注意單位不同要先換算<br/>
      ③ <b>比較題：</b>「誰較多/重/長？相差多少？」
    </div>
</div>
<div class="lf-ex"><div class="lf-ex-title">例4</div><div class="lf-ex-q">小明體重 32.8 kg，爸爸體重是小明的 2 倍多 5.4 kg。爸爸體重 = ？</div></div>
<div class="lf-h2">知識點一至三 同步練習</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">6</td><td>買書 $28.50、文具 $15.80。付 $50，找續 = ？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:80px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">7</td><td>繩長 3 米。用咗 1.45 米。剩下 = ？米 = ？厘米</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:80px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">8</td><td>蘋果重 0.35 kg，橙重 0.28 kg。蘋果比橙重多少克？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:80px;"></td></tr>
</table>
</div>
<div>
<div class="lf-h1">三、Tiered Practice （20 min）</div>
<div class="lf-h2">🌱 Foundation Tier（All Must Complete，共 3 題）</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">9</td><td>鉛筆 $3.50，買 3 枝，共付多少？付 $20，找續 = ？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:85px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">10</td><td>一條路長 1.8 km。行咗 0.65 km，剩下多少 km？多少 m？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:80px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">11</td><td>一個西瓜重 2.4 kg，一個哈密瓜重 1.85 kg。共重多少 kg？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:80px;"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h2">🌿 Intermediate Tier（🚶🚀 Optional，共 3 題）</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
